{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t金管局數字顯示，截至第3季末，負資產住宅按揭貸款宗數3819宗，按季減少逾12%；涉及金額173億元，按季減少約12%。無抵押部分金額8億元，按季減少1億元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n金管局說，有關個案主要涉及銀行職員住屋按揭貸款或按揭保險計劃貸款，按揭成數一般較高。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n拖欠3個月以上負資產住宅按揭貸款比率升至1.34%，按季上升0.09個百分點。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:23:55.821372+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:52:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:32.781903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:32.781903+00:00","content_hash":"669debaae57607aff819ba8dfd3b595235e97be38c5374e7e095767d3ee4b869","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}